<title>USA: Hvide appoints board member, targets buys.</title>
<headline>Hvide appoints board member, targets buys.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hvide Marine Inc said on Monday that it had appointed Walter Zorkers as senior vice president in charge of corporate development.</p>
<p>&quot;Walt has more than 80 acquisitions under his belt, and we plan to add to that number as we pursue our core strategy of growth through acquisition and consolidation in our four niche businesses,&quot; the marine support and transport services company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Prior to his appointment, Zorkers was principal consultant at Commonwealth Management Group, which provides planning, management and merger and acquisition services.</p>
<p>((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
